<title>UK: Rheinhyp prices 1.0 bln mark seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinhyp prices 1.0 bln mark seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, BZW, CDC Marche, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and HSBC Trinkaus has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK (RHEINHYP)</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    15.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.00     PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    97.81     SPREAD	+1 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    11 BP     SELL CONC  19 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT JULY 15 2004 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES	SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		PFANDBRIEF ISSUE</p>
